{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1229703-in-which-we-exalted-ize-our-favorite-epics-for-sidereal-plot-ideas","id":1229703,"title":"In which we Exalted-ize our favorite epics for Sidereal plot ideas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-23T19:14:09-07:00","id":1229703,"title":"In which we Exalted-ize our favorite epics for Sidereal plot ideas","content":"<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\">The Sidereals are in charge of making sure Fate happens the way it should. This makes it incredibly easy to come up with really awesome adventures. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\">1. Take the great epic story of your choice, and translate it into Exalted terms.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\">2. Pay special attention to all the places where one word said differently would have made the whole house of cards come crashing down.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\">3. Your NPCs said those words differently.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\">4. The Sidereal PCs' job is to make sure the story happens the way it's supposed to, or else ALL OF CREATION DIES. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\">5. Demons, Exalts, Deathlords, ghosts, Fair Folk and renegade gods will object to your meddling. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\">For instance, Exalted-Paris is supposed to cuckold Exalted-Menelaus by seducing Exalted-Helen, triggering the Exalted Trojan War. However, for the one time in his life, the damn fool is keeping it in his pants. If he doesn't sleep with her the Outcaste chieftains of Exalted-Greece won't form an alliance to destroy Fair-folk-infested Troy, and the entire Hundred Kingdoms will FALL INTO THE WYLD.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\">The PCs' job is to make sure that Exalted-Paris and Exalted-Helen do end up in bed with each other and that war consumes the Hundred Kingdoms the way it's supposed to.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Exaltedize an epic story and figure out what went wrong that the Sidereal PCs have to fix.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-25T12:41:33-07:00","id":1230085,"title":"","content":"Not on topic, but perhaps inspirational for Sidereal players: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x1WMrTUFVfo\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x1WMrTUFVfo</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-25T16:02:24-07:00","id":1230115,"title":"","content":"The forces of the strongest kingdom, leader of the great confederation of jungle states of the Southeast, is waging a war of influence in the East. From the West, its great foe, who it had thought distracted on its own western side secured peace. The eastern army, full of great firedust cannons and elephants and daemon-blooded soldiers, marches to the capital unopposed. The capital holds out for 40 days, just long enough for the hill-barbarians to the south to sweep in with 10,000 tiger cavalry, the largest massed charge since the first age, and rout the Western army.<br /> <br /> Or that's how its supposed to go.<br /> Except the Eastern country is in a paranoid peace, threatening to attack the hill tribes to the south, the western country is bogged down in a truly unending war with its own further western enemy. And there is a purge within the country of its fabled daemon-blooded warriors. And the hill tribes are in civil war.<br /> And the elephants are disappearing.<br /> You have two years to recreate the charge of the winged hussars. Go: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=75zmIj_4LFQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=75zmIj_4LFQ</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4959-drdog","name":"DrDog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}